Package: glyhub
Title: Curated Glycomics and Glycoproteomics Data Resources
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Bin", "Fu", , "23110220018@m.fudan.edu.cn", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-8567-2997"))
Description: Provides access to curated public glycomics and glycoproteomics
    datasets from GlycoPOST, CPTAC, and published studies as 'glyexp' 'GlycomicSE' and
    'GlycoproteomicSE' objects. Datasets preserve source molecular annotations,
    measurement provenance, and explicit processing records. A catalog and
    shared loader retrieve data from versioned GitHub Releases, verify file
    integrity with SHA-256 checksums, and cache downloads for offline reuse.
